(18: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Search%20online%2C%20and%20GitHub%20for%20associative%20versions%20of%20all%20our%20dependencies.%20And%20fully%20implement%20all%20the%20same%20features%20in%20JavaScript.%0A%0AAs%20it%20is%20needed%20for%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Frelative-meta-logic%2Fpull%2F182%2C%20and%20also%20in%20other%20projects.%0A%0AWe%20need%20to%20add%20CI%2FCD%20rule%20that%20gurantees%2C%20that%20all%20features%20that%20are%20present%20in%20Rust%20will%20also%20be%20in%20JavaScript%20and%20vice%20versa.%20So%20next%20time%20when%20one%20language%20version%20is%20changed%2C%20both%20languages%20forced%20to%20be%20changed.%0A%0AUse%20.%2Fjs%2C%20.%2Frust%20folders%20in%20root%2C%20with%20their%20own%20src%2C%20tests%2C%20scripts.%20And%20also%20js.yml%20and%20rust.yml%20for%20CI%2FCD.%0A%0AUse%20all%20the%20best%20practices%20from%20CI%2FCD%20templates%20%28check%20full%20file%20tree%20to%20compare%20for%20all%20GitHub%20workflow%20and%20CI%2FCD%20scripts%20file%29%2C%20if%20the%20same%20issue%20is%20found%20in%20template%20report%20issue%20also%20in%20templates%3A%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fjs-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Frust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fpython-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fcsharp-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%0A%0AWe%20should%20compare%20all%20files%2C%20so%20we%20don%27t%20have%20more%20CI%2FCD%20errors%20in%20the%20future%20and%20reuse%20all%20the%20best%20practices%20from%20these%20templates.%0A%0AWe%20need%20to%20collect%20data%20related%20about%20the%20issue%20to%20this%20repository%2C%20make%20sure%20we%20compile%20that%20data%20to%20%60.%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-%7Bid%7D%60%20folder%2C%20and%20use%20it%20to%20do%20deep%20case%20study%20analysis%20%28also%20make%20sure%20to%20search%20online%20for%20additional%20facts%20and%20data%29%2C%20list%20of%20each%20and%20all%20requirements%20from%20the%20issue%2C%20and%20propose%20possible%20solutions%20and%20solution%20plans%20for%20each%20requirement%20%28we%20should%20also%20check%20known%20existing%20components%2Flibraries%2C%20that%20solve%20similar%20problem%20or%20can%20help%20in%20solutions%29.%0A%0APlease%20plan%20and%20execute%20everything%20in%20this%20single%20pull%20request%2C%20you%20have%20unlimited%20time%20and%20context%2C%20as%20context%20auto-compacts%20and%20you%20can%20continue%20indefinitely%2C%20until%20it%20is%20each%20and%20every%20requirement%20fully%20addressed%2C%20and%20everything%20is%20totally%20done.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
